---
import Prose from "../layouts/Prose.astro";
import { SITE } from "../lib/site";
---
<Prose title="Contact Gunther Heller" h1="Contact us" path="/contact/"
  description="How to reach Gunther Heller: corrections to a nutrition number, data questions, press and partnership requests."
  lead="We read every message. A person replies within one business day.">
  <h2>Email</h2>
  <p><a href={`mailto:${SITE.email}`}>{SITE.email}</a></p>
  <h2>Reporting a wrong number</h2>
  <p>Tell us the page, the number and your source (a label, a USDA record, a chain's nutrition guide). Every food page also has a link that fills this in for you. We check corrections against USDA FoodData Central and FoodKeeper; see our <a href="/editorial-policy/">editorial policy</a>.</p>
  <h2>Data and partnership questions</h2>
  <p>Questions about how we use USDA data are answered in our <a href="/methodology/">methodology</a>. For anything else, including press and partnerships, email us at the address above.</p>
</Prose>
